        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "i want autoload session if vim opened in specific folder without using local session file. \nI could create autocmd to check `mini.sessions.detected` table but it stores path to session file itself not path it `:cd` when loaded.\nSo i want another field in detected table with path it :cd into.",
